<title>CANADA: Canadian Utilities redeems preference shares.</title>
<headline>Canadian Utilities redeems preference shares.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>ATCO Ltd affiliate Canadian Utilities Ltd said on Monday it redeemed 3.1 million cumulative redeemable second preferred shares, series P, for a total amount of C$76.9 million.</p>
<p>CU said the move left 1.9 million of the preference shares outstanding.</p>
<p>((Reuters Calgary Bureau (403) 531-1624))</p>
